#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:12
msgid ""
"The ``Configure - KStars`` window is divided into fourteen pages: "
"``Catalogs``, ``Solar System``, ``Satellites``, ``Supernovae``, ``Guides``, "
"``Terrain``, ``Image Overlays``, ``Colors``, ``FITS``, ``INDI``, ``Ekos``, "
"``Xplanet``, ``Advanced`` and ``Developer``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:17
msgid ""
"In the ``Catalogs`` page, you determine several properties concerning the "
"display of the star and deep sky object catalogs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:21
msgid ""
"In the ``Solar System`` page, you can specify whether the Sun, Moon, "
"planets, comets and asteroids are displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:24
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> page allows you to set the color scheme, "
#| "and to define custom color schemes. The tab is split into two panels:"
msgid "The ``Satellites`` page allows you to set the satellites view options."
msgstr ""
"A páxina <guilabel>Cores</guilabel> permite escoller o esquema de cores e "
"definir esquemas de cores personalizados. A lapela divídese en dous paneis:"

#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> page provides fine-grained control over "
#| "the more subtle behaviors of &kstars;."
msgid ""
"The ``Supernovae`` page allows you to manage how supernovae are displayed by "
"KStars."
msgstr ""
"A páxina <guilabel>Avanzado</guilabel> fornece un control detallado dos "
"comportamentos máis sutís do &kstars;."

#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:30
msgid ""
"The ``Guides`` page lets you toggle whether non-objects are displayed (i.e., "
"constellation lines, constellation names, the Milky Way contour)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:34
msgid ""
"It is possible to choose a ``Sky culture``: for the constellation lines and "
"names on this page. The current version of KStars includes data for more "
"than a dozen sky cultures."
msgstr ""

