#: ../../user_manual/viewops.rst:65
msgid ""
"The ``Developer`` page allows you to enable or disable a few options mostly "
"useful for developers or for folks looking to help debug issues. Currently "
"these are enabling the saving of images during Ekos's autofocus, guiding and "
"alignment."
msgstr ""
